  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "日记与信札在文学中显得尤为独特，因为它们比其他文体更能鲜明地展现作者的个性。",
      "output_sha256": "b9e37d4d33e2a3abf973e41517f6f420e4fdf259c54aad7d547053e26dfc8aca",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": 0.511137,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        1
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "8cbbca0da82ded1486e30ec97301a90b06c3348483a2f2d0d5c9a44481358263"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b9e37d4d33e2a3abf973e41517f6f420e4fdf259c54aad7d547053e26dfc8aca",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "诗词、小说和戏剧往往是为公众创作，因此，尽管艺术表现更加精致，却难免带有一些做作的痕迹。",
      "output_sha256": "13d99fcf17568f7e21cd6290f8b63fe87d5ab28ac4cf76e7ded1c4dd772bae77",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": 0.455803,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        2
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "cb15c970781afbfbfcc5d7d4efe44fdacd4d09a6fac1773a6cc5a22bcee82415"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_ai_sha256": "13d99fcf17568f7e21cd6290f8b63fe87d5ab28ac4cf76e7ded1c4dd772bae77",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "而信件只是写给特定的接收者，日记则是为自己而作，除了打算将来出版的情况，自然显得更加真实与自然。",
      "output_sha256": "1e503418ee1cfb5f18b49ddeac210e0a8815bf439895a80188628c64d661fde5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": 0.461369,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        3
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "3c72ac70cbb06eed6dca6ac0270c2a1f56c99993d6a4fda752484983062cbca0"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_ai_sha256": "1e503418ee1cfb5f18b49ddeac210e0a8815bf439895a80188628c64d661fde5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "作为一个写作者，我常常觉得自己的作品有些做作，因此我更喜欢阅读他人的日记和信札，从中感受到很多乐趣。",
      "output_sha256": "2d48b0bcc3a2e5fca6ef3a2f5d14602adb34fb0a1def1e0b75b1120d540e7385",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": 0.395578,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        4
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "c605203d98b59c19b4bb08d62f5c2eedcbedbbb9f4d377154b5299bbe1758392"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_ai_sha256": "2d48b0bcc3a2e5fca6ef3a2f5d14602adb34fb0a1def1e0b75b1120d540e7385",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我不擅长写日记，更不善于书信交流，虽然心中对自己的真实感受有些隐约的认知，但一旦尝试写下来，哪怕是私密的文字，总是难免显得做作。",
      "output_sha256": "1a0abe14fa743bf92c2551f2cee1a2b0bb14c95f48594e384ef1bca9b9a133ec",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": 0.512528,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        5
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d99d66fddcc8398d8c41c4840ebd88babf849bfa6096d08e758120175a5f5cd3"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_ai_sha256": "1a0abe14fa743bf92c2551f2cee1a2b0bb14c95f48594e384ef1bca9b9a133ec",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        5,
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "并非故意如此，而是因为修养不足，这也让我对他人的日记和信札愈加欣赏。",
      "output_sha256": "51405a1b520701fc50e03d4947606af140a287d9aecfed185fd297280daddef0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": 0.512528,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        5
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d99d66fddcc8398d8c41c4840ebd88babf849bfa6096d08e758120175a5f5cd3"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_ai_sha256": "51405a1b520701fc50e03d4947606af140a287d9aecfed185fd297280daddef0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        5,
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "中国的信札历史悠久，既有优美的文章又充满趣味，但最优秀的作品更能体现出作者的性格。",
      "output_sha256": "b4d1f9326fac5980c2fcbe05c1b5d1669b81b775f81effcd78d9bf0b5e2eca2e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": 0.374234,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "4a1434670776645bb08f5adbed3350941ab7fb1b31a25bac368de274333d8fff"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b4d1f9326fac5980c2fcbe05c1b5d1669b81b775f81effcd78d9bf0b5e2eca2e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "《全晋文》中录王羲之杂帖，有这两章：",
      "output_sha256": "43c612587c4933a019167b99c309910b37f4e155ecf966e89e520b873d1f7c32",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "43c612587c4933a019167b99c309910b37f4e155ecf966e89e520b873d1f7c32",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“吾顷无一日佳，衰老之弊日至，夏不得有所啖，而犹有劳务，甚劣劣。”",
      "output_sha256": "d6230393ada672d4bf4269961a2a87f6ca838a38ac625fb7031db4b8cf274fda",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_human_sha256": "d6230393ada672d4bf4269961a2a87f6ca838a38ac625fb7031db4b8cf274fda",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“不审复何似？",
      "output_sha256": "c9867515764be2464f48822612f064f5de0315dd200fbccd64ba293dac603f48",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_human_sha256": "c9867515764be2464f48822612f064f5de0315dd200fbccd64ba293dac603f48",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "永日多少看未？",
      "output_sha256": "13a33d6462269759e356ea111227cdac8964ebeff9c35265a9ece59889947ff3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "13a33d6462269759e356ea111227cdac8964ebeff9c35265a9ece59889947ff3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "九日当采菊不？",
      "output_sha256": "a9d061e9f990854dcdc9ec052f74d3b414163ac57a9f7aff957f94569f63dda0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_human_sha256": "a9d061e9f990854dcdc9ec052f74d3b414163ac57a9f7aff957f94569f63dda0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "至日欲共行也，但不知当晴不耳？”",
      "output_sha256": "b040e3f09eec319d339dde5e5240f628f92fcfa4281f89b66ed831ab7a78b44c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "b040e3f09eec319d339dde5e5240f628f92fcfa4281f89b66ed831ab7a78b44c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我觉得这要比“奉橘三百颗”还有意思。",
      "output_sha256": "a333bcb866f75044d054f87c52b2e31bd16362468feeab142dccd2e5edfd0bb4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_human_sha256": "a333bcb866f75044d054f87c52b2e31bd16362468feeab142dccd2e5edfd0bb4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "日本诗人芭蕉（Bashō）有这样一封向他的门人借钱的信，在寥寥数语中画出一个飘逸的俳人来。",
      "output_sha256": "e01780ee648b9929dfff04e8d516b3142f0fd5b800cead79709131ff895c2376",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "e01780ee648b9929dfff04e8d516b3142f0fd5b800cead79709131ff895c2376",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“欲往芳野行脚，希惠借银五钱。",
      "output_sha256": "e81ed0127536b6cc1a099bb2347e3962b384e7bb510e7c6d122007fac9f8d1bd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_human_sha256": "e81ed0127536b6cc1a099bb2347e3962b384e7bb510e7c6d122007fac9f8d1bd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "此系勒借，容当奉还。",
      "output_sha256": "1827a7caa2c067e01787f0708bf859b694c56d622dbb47cf5e51a8c56d4bf8c2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_human_sha256": "1827a7caa2c067e01787f0708bf859b694c56d622dbb47cf5e51a8c56d4bf8c2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "唯老夫之事，亦殊难说耳。",
      "output_sha256": "345a0cc101f8e836bbaabca49d5315fbca8a6053e477c094dc2207583cefbb6f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_human_sha256": "345a0cc101f8e836bbaabca49d5315fbca8a6053e477c094dc2207583cefbb6f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "去来君 芭蕉。”",
      "output_sha256": "9ddc4396a9d2ae00d1f6382b22f35318b406b37a26bd57cfa9c01344bcf218c4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "9ddc4396a9d2ae00d1f6382b22f35318b406b37a26bd57cfa9c01344bcf218c4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "日记也是一种重要的考证资料。",
      "output_sha256": "cdfccdbf9a52d785f2bbe5a1a8aa165242aed4a508522bbcd1296373a31d0290",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": 0.619966,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        19
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "250ee35ad27495e0d5edd46d083009723cfa5d10e62f3ee7e87e01ceaf0145c4"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_ai_sha256": "cdfccdbf9a52d785f2bbe5a1a8aa165242aed4a508522bbcd1296373a31d0290",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "近阅汪辉祖的《病榻梦痕录》上卷，乾隆二十年（1755）项下有这几句话：",
      "output_sha256": "24b8f15640f37f1deb0d0fb5781385d0706840b6c639fcb738459d214ea2eac6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "24b8f15640f37f1deb0d0fb5781385d0706840b6c639fcb738459d214ea2eac6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“绍兴秋收大歉。",
      "output_sha256": "5ecb37d6a517cfd11a3735480708ba2b9fe63bd2bef6515f9350d9aefc4bf970",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "5ecb37d6a517cfd11a3735480708ba2b9fe63bd2bef6515f9350d9aefc4bf970",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "次年春夏之交，米价斗三百钱，丐殍载道。”",
      "output_sha256": "5c200af859e74f7de108cb920f24f8a0612a8bd6068f666285092f003fe7e6f1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_human_sha256": "5c200af859e74f7de108cb920f24f8a0612a8bd6068f666285092f003fe7e6f1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "同五十九年（1794）项下又云：",
      "output_sha256": "7cec241ef8df894cf5f4a07246cfa262c5e5cdeccbef9df7bf3ad23d455bf3be",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_human_sha256": "7cec241ef8df894cf5f4a07246cfa262c5e5cdeccbef9df7bf3ad23d455bf3be",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“夏间米一斗钱三百三四十文。",
      "output_sha256": "984b009e9e3378cbb356ea2e72d64c8f2782e42130982e77cd68cb36106a81d8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_human_sha256": "984b009e9e3378cbb356ea2e72d64c8f2782e42130982e77cd68cb36106a81d8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "往时米价至一百五六十文，即有饿殍，今米常贵而人尚乐生，盖往年专贵在米，今则鱼虾蔬果无一不贵，故小贩村农俱可糊口。”",
      "output_sha256": "8b5264dfd5e27f84acf1d8cb5368130680efd5f9fcace88899688df8cd9bbff8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_human_sha256": "8b5264dfd5e27f84acf1d8cb5368130680efd5f9fcace88899688df8cd9bbff8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "这些都是研究经济史的宝贵材料，同时也反映出他精明的性格。",
      "output_sha256": "da7f2c71fb2e0b7a04069db676a0d6b439416728741b1295210ef811368d6174",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": 0.647241,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        26
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "8e70f9b7bb94e0bfca667cbbd122deb8565c1a3c9118afd449a6238919bc4a89"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_ai_sha256": "da7f2c71fb2e0b7a04069db676a0d6b439416728741b1295210ef811368d6174",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        27
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "日本俳人一茶（Issa）的日记一部分流行于世，最新发见刊行的为《一茶旅日记》，文化元年（1804）十二月中有记事云：",
      "output_sha256": "2aaf2ea2d4d617493fad4aaac050f1e26e9fcc4417dc73fddd0c80f11fbbb1f2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_human_sha256": "2aaf2ea2d4d617493fad4aaac050f1e26e9fcc4417dc73fddd0c80f11fbbb1f2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“二十七日阴，买锅。",
      "output_sha256": "d6adf0d8d00adb462578d928255ba2da104af1bf736f785aedbdb1fd2bd2f8b2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_human_sha256": "d6adf0d8d00adb462578d928255ba2da104af1bf736f785aedbdb1fd2bd2f8b2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "二十九日雨，买酱。”",
      "output_sha256": "429af3f6e26f0fd75228dd90defe25bc5fd5d6e950ed20301e918cb7bd76c8d6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_human_sha256": "429af3f6e26f0fd75228dd90defe25bc5fd5d6e950ed20301e918cb7bd76c8d6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "十几个字里贫穷之状表现无遗。",
      "output_sha256": "8fb216d6ce015c5ce607f0d1cef7378c372de75567c54bf59e62f5ae5143c421",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_human_sha256": "8fb216d6ce015c5ce607f0d1cef7378c372de75567c54bf59e62f5ae5143c421",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "同年五月的记录中还有：",
      "output_sha256": "6b3d461aea324dab9de15489a048ffbad3e7276ba86da4ebd250550eebdf9ffc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": 0.451765,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        31
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "3105b0b7cb539252a90b07f6fba9efa25002a727aa8715891b1ac559038f3abd"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_ai_sha256": "6b3d461aea324dab9de15489a048ffbad3e7276ba86da4ebd250550eebdf9ffc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        32
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 15,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“七日晴，投水男女二人浮出吾妻桥下。”",
      "output_sha256": "a3125780c5c4a2e4e146b4c81f4e3e95a64fee8c9957cc82a82b0513763f898c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_human_sha256": "a3125780c5c4a2e4e146b4c81f4e3e95a64fee8c9957cc82a82b0513763f898c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 15,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "此外还多同类的记事，年月从略：",
      "output_sha256": "99536490e00a8b9808c7e29f904e524eedefaa109b1a86379bf5ac03500e2c99",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_human_sha256": "99536490e00a8b9808c7e29f904e524eedefaa109b1a86379bf5ac03500e2c99",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 16,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“九日晴，南风。",
      "output_sha256": "a2c71edf384b682ba7a2acc60a033af043e3d8717fa5283e569d44e7ade75548",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_human_sha256": "a2c71edf384b682ba7a2acc60a033af043e3d8717fa5283e569d44e7ade75548",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 16,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "妓女花井火刑。”",
      "output_sha256": "4c4e945639710d06e9e93fef8a016ccb429746883cb5debe7ce14f6ed864c8d8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_human_sha256": "4c4e945639710d06e9e93fef8a016ccb429746883cb5debe7ce14f6ed864c8d8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 17,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“二十四日晴。",
      "output_sha256": "5d687e5a8dd2b1ff9987263d7270c9cdb77ca7e40ef529cbee93a88c26eb17df",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_human_sha256": "5d687e5a8dd2b1ff9987263d7270c9cdb77ca7e40ef529cbee93a88c26eb17df",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 17,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "夜，庵前板桥被人窃去。",
      "output_sha256": "ef7c314725d71d354ff9500745a6d3c210f7e0e7c98baadae9a613d768322a9c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_human_sha256": "ef7c314725d71d354ff9500745a6d3c210f7e0e7c98baadae9a613d768322a9c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 18,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "二十五日雨。",
      "output_sha256": "d1106fbbfa5dd9f804f2c4d3da33adffa7f6b1e549e0b90a70181c36a18e746b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_human_sha256": "d1106fbbfa5dd9f804f2c4d3da33adffa7f6b1e549e0b90a70181c36a18e746b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 18,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "所余板桥被窃。”",
      "output_sha256": "59545a9f4362013da465e2e57e7e88f6597e80d7b537e872846ecc60aee24d12",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_human_sha256": "59545a9f4362013da465e2e57e7e88f6597e80d7b537e872846ecc60aee24d12",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 19,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "这些看似零散的句子却蕴含着丰富的暗示力量，读后让我们仿佛能感受到作者的身影与背景，其效果或许超越了他所作的俳句。",
      "output_sha256": "b1bef37a5225fdad73c8cb076a6fee3c84225964fc1de9bac7ad1f7f0b6ec741",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": 0.499575,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        40
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "dee192dfc3b00e709e4899f48133003619482f92fe4b7c629c25416ff306ca3e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b1bef37a5225fdad73c8cb076a6fee3c84225964fc1de9bac7ad1f7f0b6ec741",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        41
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 19,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我喜欢一茶的文集《俺的春天》，但同样也爱他的日记，尽管其中除了吟咏外仅有寥寥几行的记录，但我依旧觉得其中充满了文艺的趣味。",
      "output_sha256": "cae4846ea2318ecec90237b70b20ef4c34bea121d949b99f3857f125f333ebec",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": 0.602038,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        41
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "482f8445dfca2030b197ab24e4536c153a9b58d4e972ef90c4b80c2deedd0855"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_ai_sha256": "cae4846ea2318ecec90237b70b20ef4c34bea121d949b99f3857f125f333ebec",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        42
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 20,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "在外国文人的日记与信札中，有一些关于中国人的文章也颇为有趣，特此抄录，与读者分享。",
      "output_sha256": "8a214b0b0c4d5d16e52406a263ac2429cd1f6892a8d23db93968560a84687b2a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": 0.621624,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        42
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b3422f058fc69d909f0a1e5ba59988965246d941b61d339c7cf825461d196b9c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_ai_sha256": "8a214b0b0c4d5d16e52406a263ac2429cd1f6892a8d23db93968560a84687b2a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        43
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 20,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "如果读者对此感到愤怒而非欢笑，那确实是介绍者的失误，我愿意致以歉意，只希望大家不要责怪原作者。",
      "output_sha256": "0f528cc9127afd0d941e4a8a8a8064e077db0a52a34ea92343f8a14afd7541be",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": 0.457791,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        43
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "dfac472246951cd52e82d1eb657bd8d9d16e93607ee5efd65d0215676a9e51af"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_ai_sha256": "0f528cc9127afd0d941e4a8a8a8064e077db0a52a34ea92343f8a14afd7541be",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        44
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 21,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "夏目漱石在明治四十二年（1909）的日记中提到：",
      "output_sha256": "d7f765b9e0916d4be2ae5a2546e33ba165c2e509a9fe22d611446d425e96f527",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
      "alignment_score": 0.720194,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        44
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "e800b55aae1cb2a6fe5675e43d25c685510e77bc32048d2728e286e286cd8e33"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d7f765b9e0916d4be2ae5a2546e33ba165c2e509a9fe22d611446d425e96f527",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        45
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 46,
      "paragraph_index": 22,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“七月三日",
      "output_sha256": "b1cbf7db44afe9501c28c388f20baa1bff01b0bc33b6f44fc7e411aae34f29be",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_human_sha256": "b1cbf7db44afe9501c28c388f20baa1bff01b0bc33b6f44fc7e411aae34f29be",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 47,
      "paragraph_index": 23,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "晨六时地震。",
      "output_sha256": "8b9cd6ea0fa64830ba6433495ea8e7b9d11ef1a97c6d9217e6ba3553da15e3cc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 46,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 46,
      "source_human_sha256": "8b9cd6ea0fa64830ba6433495ea8e7b9d11ef1a97c6d9217e6ba3553da15e3cc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 48,
      "paragraph_index": 23,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "夜有支那人来，站在栅门前说把这个开了。",
      "output_sha256": "2506bbb5a6c146a4dea193a6d6bcf212e49562d83f020e7f44704be2f1044c5b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 47,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 47,
      "source_human_sha256": "2506bbb5a6c146a4dea193a6d6bcf212e49562d83f020e7f44704be2f1044c5b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 49,
      "paragraph_index": 23,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "问是谁，来干什么，答说我你家里的事都听见，姑娘八位，使女三位，三块钱。",
      "output_sha256": "908715af4ed1191c7880750c0fd746cc0776a6fa9f2c6755b8c83c4fc1da0bcf",
      "alignment_unit_index": 48,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_human_sha256": "908715af4ed1191c7880750c0fd746cc0776a6fa9f2c6755b8c83c4fc1da0bcf",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 50,
      "paragraph_index": 23,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "完全像个疯子。",
      "output_sha256": "a6e06f3e78842daf689d0993af0a70b01e0a225e4dfe542c521a024262cdc7fc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 49,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 49,
      "source_human_sha256": "a6e06f3e78842daf689d0993af0a70b01e0a225e4dfe542c521a024262cdc7fc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 51,
      "paragraph_index": 23,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "说你走罢也仍不回去，说还不走要交给警察了，答说我是钦差，随出去了。",
      "output_sha256": "b7ae3b2875eb1aafe9dc539b7a3fd08843357cfddc41eb3445ae110647cbf8a6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 50,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 50,
      "source_human_sha256": "b7ae3b2875eb1aafe9dc539b7a3fd08843357cfddc41eb3445ae110647cbf8a6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 52,
      "paragraph_index": 23,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "是个荒谬的东西。”",
      "output_sha256": "a4deb96c2057326e72b528abb595cb0eed0e06e820aefdda61427ad453015e46",
      "alignment_unit_index": 51,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 51,
      "source_human_sha256": "a4deb96c2057326e72b528abb595cb0eed0e06e820aefdda61427ad453015e46",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 53,
      "paragraph_index": 24,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "以上摘自《漱石全集》第十一卷，接下来是从英译的《契诃夫书简集》中抄译的一封信。",
      "output_sha256": "0aa30e8309994d2de7e4fbb4f4deec9b9de94995dc31a257591f980c27e57675",
      "alignment_unit_index": 52,
      "alignment_score": 0.769709,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        52
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "88d58ea5069046d60ba4c411f91bf4fc897b9ea9b69fde1c3f50814644f48764"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 53,
      "source_ai_sha256": "0aa30e8309994d2de7e4fbb4f4deec9b9de94995dc31a257591f980c27e57675",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        53
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 54,
      "paragraph_index": 25,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "契诃夫在1890年六月二十九日的信中写道：",
      "output_sha256": "f81fd02b5fa1bc44c67993569ad99a1945dc8a1235f264edb8a42feeb0d9d249",
      "alignment_unit_index": 53,
      "alignment_score": 0.594035,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        53,
        54
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "402ffcf83438708c11e18d31d88a5e6a914aa092bbc8c6e00c674bef18424278",
        "63a775d6a73c80abba8aa85ea338778372c8d5616c5bfcc48dad4f9b45beb055"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 54,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f81fd02b5fa1bc44c67993569ad99a1945dc8a1235f264edb8a42feeb0d9d249",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        54,
        55
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 55,
      "paragraph_index": 26,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "“我在木拉伏夫轮船上。",
      "output_sha256": "8c671709c17cac0bae01170c941437c5d9debd730c615e76caf9ac3c9cf6d426",
      "alignment_unit_index": 53,
      "alignment_score": 0.594035,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        53,
        54
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "402ffcf83438708c11e18d31d88a5e6a914aa092bbc8c6e00c674bef18424278",
        "63a775d6a73c80abba8aa85ea338778372c8d5616c5bfcc48dad4f9b45beb055"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 55,
      "source_ai_sha256": "8c671709c17cac0bae01170c941437c5d9debd730c615e76caf9ac3c9cf6d426",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        54,
        55
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 56,
      "paragraph_index": 27,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我的舱里流星纷飞，——这是有光的甲虫，好像是电气的火光。",
      "output_sha256": "ef50b455b351a42f072d93a1af523833c3d46509945edaeddd5d8c82cf6d5d73",
      "alignment_unit_index": 54,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 55,
      "source_human_sha256": "ef50b455b351a42f072d93a1af523833c3d46509945edaeddd5d8c82cf6d5d73",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 57,
      "paragraph_index": 27,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "白昼里野羊游泳过黑龙江。",
      "output_sha256": "084248c4f489c569adcf5a247e058b242d57f61e21be93fd9fc836d83b10f1d8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 55,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 56,
      "source_human_sha256": "084248c4f489c569adcf5a247e058b242d57f61e21be93fd9fc836d83b10f1d8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 58,
      "paragraph_index": 27,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这里的苍蝇很大。",
      "output_sha256": "4241f0380e9793eb00ac388538326ace88692ebba9f4530b664b896e33a8f0ca",
      "alignment_unit_index": 56,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 57,
      "source_human_sha256": "4241f0380e9793eb00ac388538326ace88692ebba9f4530b664b896e33a8f0ca",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 59,
      "paragraph_index": 27,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我和一个契丹人同舱，名叫宋路理，他屡次告诉我，在契丹为了一点小事就要‘头落地’。",
      "output_sha256": "a0c1c9df1a7da757468d10fa98b1b38be95fbcba4f3317387850d2a3d66b7b6f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 57,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 58,
      "source_human_sha256": "a0c1c9df1a7da757468d10fa98b1b38be95fbcba4f3317387850d2a3d66b7b6f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 60,
      "paragraph_index": 27,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "昨夜他吸鸦片烟醉了，睡梦中只是讲话，使我不能睡觉。",
      "output_sha256": "1a89553f3289ed338cbcf37faf0ce8a9c912ae4d9c6c79fc9d241bb8ec737814",
      "alignment_unit_index": 58,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 59,
      "source_human_sha256": "1a89553f3289ed338cbcf37faf0ce8a9c912ae4d9c6c79fc9d241bb8ec737814",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 61,
      "paragraph_index": 27,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "二十七日我在契丹爱珲城近地一走。",
      "output_sha256": "0d3ad776162ec0ba48fd0d15e2df6f5c7fce0cb8e6072a98cd2ed9554169d8a5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 59,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 60,
      "source_human_sha256": "0d3ad776162ec0ba48fd0d15e2df6f5c7fce0cb8e6072a98cd2ed9554169d8a5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 62,
      "paragraph_index": 27,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我似乎渐渐的走进一个怪异的世界里去了。",
      "output_sha256": "b0353b5455eb8c177562dd544a2fa34bce9adf6c5e4330f05ea7188132278c9e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 60,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 61,
      "source_human_sha256": "b0353b5455eb8c177562dd544a2fa34bce9adf6c5e4330f05ea7188132278c9e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 63,
      "paragraph_index": 27,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "轮船播动，不好写字。",
